 box for Fox. Package the view and avatar resources on the classpath and make the Gradle application entry point launch the GUI.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1},"fxml":{"insertions":43,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":149,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"6b79a5647d2aa9d75f1be2b0e06771fbf0d3344c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Connect Fox logic to the GUI","messageBody":"Expose a response-oriented command entry point while keeping the existing console loop, parser, task list, and storage behavior intact. Allow UI responses to target a supplied stream and add a regression test covering GUI commands and reload persistence.\n","tags":["Level-10"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":91,"deletions":30}}},{"hash":"5a94bb7815dc8388a31a4fcee5bc32db1a187253","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch-Level-10","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"618bcc0ada85344b837927832459eaafcf3a180d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use varargs for initial task list items","messageBody":"TaskList callers may supply zero, one, or multiple initial tasks, but the array-first constructor forced repetitive array creation. Accepting Task... keeps the API type-safe and makes setup call sites clearer while preserving array compatibility for storage-loaded tasks.\n","tags":["A-Varargs"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":15,"deletions":5}}},{"hash":"a581102a785a3d72e34188136139d062d440b85c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch-A-Varargs","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"7183e74ebddc0bc6653eac3f5f4fbcd6029ea0b0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Sync new data","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"txt":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-06T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"72334d06f0ec326085702021e2b07140fa26258c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"GUI: Complete JavaFX tutorial styling","messageBody":"The JavaFX window still uses fixed-position controls and has no visual\\ncustomization from tutorial part 5. This leaves the weekly tutorial\\nrequirement incomplete.\\n\\nAnchor the main controls so they resize with the window, enforce a usable\\nminimum window size, and link CSS styles for controls, dialog bubbles,\\nand profile images.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"fxml":{"insertions":18,"deletions":6},"java":{"insertions":3,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-10T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"e50b07f32d0389f61cbd0804e4c9d836e7695224","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-javafx-part5\u0027","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"6b619714b4d41daccc499050cb4fc5fe3701e041","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions for internal invariants","messageBody":"Fox relies on assumptions about command dispatch, task-list capacity,\nand JavaFX controller setup. If those assumptions are broken, failures\ncan surface later with less useful errors.\n\nEnable assertions for Gradle runs and check these invariants close to\ntheir source so programming mistakes fail fast during development.\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":11,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-11T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"9511a54bdcf9878cb9f941205d0c2f11235cba87","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Parser: Separate task parsing logic","messageBody":"TaskParser.parse currently mixes command dispatch with validation for\nall supported task types, making the method harder to scan and maintain.\n\nExtract todo, deadline, and event parsing into focused helper methods.\nThis keeps parse centered on dispatch while preserving existing\nvalidation and user-visible behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":43,"deletions":28}}},{"hash":"54682c02d7a6d9d12d511fad662460f5bd856fcf","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Storage: Encode task fields with streams","messageBody":"Task field encoding currently manages a mutable builder and separator\nplacement with an index-based loop. That obscures the underlying\ntransform-and-join operation.\n\nMap each field through Base64 encoding and collect the results with the\nstorage separator. This keeps serialized output unchanged while making\nthe data transformation explicit.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":6,"deletions":9}}},{"hash":"750f9ac9efa903ef6fe3e71f87eee1bff491f27b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from ZhangHanzhongFox/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Add assertions for internal invariants","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"0d1f845e8afdc1bfc41bf25f2fd8dd8b2ace0c91","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"9208660250361f72dc2c24d2828b9de776fc2f74","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"604bb66aae61a15429f0dddecbcd6630d4c31d2c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from ZhangHanzhongFox/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Parser: Separate task parsing logic","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e36477c425271afd8b0e8385c06394d522166dbd","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"3d9e9fd1f33425c87ae80f2cf3fff348fb3f92d9","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from ZhangHanzhongFox/branch-A-Streams","messageBody":"Storage: Encode task fields with streams","tags":["A-Streams"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"7958aa88a468c297a558e69ccab5f24c3c4eb8a0","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"TaskList: Reject duplicate tasks","messageBody":"Fox currently allows users to add the same task repeatedly, which can\nclutter the task list and make task state ambiguous.\n\nCompare tasks by type and intrinsic details before adding them. Ignore\ncompletion status so marking a task does not permit another copy, while\nallowing tasks that differ by date or time. Document and test the\nbehavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":84,"deletions":2},"md":{"insertions":7,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"55c1bd5c168008e1d3db744dcecdb699531b6e94","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-C-DetectDuplicates\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["BCD-Extension"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"ZhangHanzhongFox":{"java":2004,"md":149,"fxml":55,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":96,"txt":5}},"authorContributionVariance":{"ZhangHanzhongFox":108134.78},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"ZhangHanzhongFox":"CS2103T-W10-4 ZHAN..HONG"}}
